  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In anti-sound desert against Feng Jiu Ge, Fang Yuan deactivates reverse flow protection seal, turns into an ancient sword dragon, then uses myriad self with that transformation. Convergence of enslavement and strength path through that pairing creates Myriad Dragon. Myriad dragons appear at once, roar as sword qi bursts out, and form a sea of silver scales that submerges the four song warriors and Feng Jiu Ge. Ying Wu Xie recognizes the move as the one Fang Yuan used when destroying their sect’s immortal Gu formation in Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        1421
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
