      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan activates Myriad Dragon again. Dragons fly into a silvery sea and encircle the song warriors until they are destroyed, while Feng Jiu Ge escapes the dragons’ range with yang pass tune. Sustaining reverse flow protection seal and ancient sword dragon transformation with the move costs many myriad self clones in the sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1426
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ge-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan calls reverse flow protection seal and myriad dragon his strongest methods, defense and offense, both related to strength path.",
